full_description: M&M Software is a software development and digitalization partner for companies
around the world. For 40 years, we have combined technical expertise with strategic
thinking and practical execution. About 360 employees at our locations in Germany,
China, and India create customized digital solutions that make businesses more
efficient and deliver measurable value.

Since 2025, SEQLY has complemented our portfolio as M&M Software’s specialized
consulting brand. SEQLY seamlessly combines strategic consulting with technical
expertise in a fully integrated process.
